{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>R星旗下的超級大作《GTA 6》已正式完成開發，並被授予進廠壓盤狀態。這標誌着遊戲的主開發階段已經結束，開發者已製作出用於分發的最終母盤。</strong>要知道在遊戲行業中，進廠壓盤意味着核心代碼已經鎖定，發行商將開始進入物理光盤的製作、包裝以及全球物流配送階段。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1585730.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.125536+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:25:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"5cca35c7afed42ca64b67e0d0eaf9be3c7cf9ef104c74bb1e135c70bc2f75851","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}